{"id":700,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"It emits a soothing aura from its ribbon-shaped organs. It wraps these appendages around quarrelers to instantly restore calm to the situation."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"There’s a Galarian fairy tale that describes a beautiful Sylveon vanquishing a dreadful dragon Pokémon."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"By releasing enmity-erasing waves from its ribbonlike feelers, Sylveon stops any conflict."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Sylveon wraps its ribbonlike feelers around its Trainer’s arm because this touch enables it to read its Trainer’s feelings."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Once a fight breaks out, it will unflinchingly charge at dragon Pokémon that are many times larger than itself."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"When this Pokémon sights its prey, it swirls its ribbonlike feelers as a distraction. A moment later, it pounces."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Its ribbonlike feelers give off an aura that weakens hostility in its prey, causing them to let down their guard. Then it attacks."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y"],"text":"It wraps its ribbonlike feelers around the arm of its beloved Trainer and walks with him or her."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X"],"text":"It sends a soothing aura from its ribbonlike feelers to calm fights."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Cute Charm","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon may infatuate attackers that make direct contact with it."},{"name":"Pixilate","hidden":true,"description":"Normal-type moves become Fairy-type moves. The power of those moves is boosted a little."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":35,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Pink","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":133,"name":"Eevee","condition":null,"children":[{"id":134,"name":"Vaporeon","condition":"Use Water Stone","children":[]},{"id":135,"name":"Jolteon","condition":"Use Thunder Stone","children":[]},{"id":136,"name":"Flareon","condition":"Use Fire Stone","c